n="00:48.863" end="00:49.283">nos</span><span begin="00:49.283" end="00:50.183">tal</span><span begin="00:50.183" end="00:50.878">gic</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而你念念不忘</span></p><p begin="00:51.548" end="00:58.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:51.548" end="00:51.993">What</span> <span begin="00:51.993" end="00:52.488">do</span> <span begin="00:52.488" end="00:52.918">we</span> <span begin="00:52.918" end="00:53.593">wan</span><span begin="00:53.593" end="00:54.217">der</span> <span begin="00:54.217" end="00:55.622">from</span> <span begin="00:55.852" end="00:56.077">and</span> <span begin="00:56.077" end="00:56.277">on</span><span begin="00:56.277" end="00:56.547">ly</span> <span begin="00:56.547" end="00:57.002">no</span><span begin="00:57.002" end="00:57.457">tice</span> <span begin="00:57.457" end="00:57.922">it</span> <span begin="00:57.922" end="00:58.837">now?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们的起点 为何现在才注意到</span></p><p begin="01:00.002" end="01:03.232" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:00.002" end="01:00.207">So</span> <span begin="01:00.207" end="01:00.657">be</span> <span begin="01:00.657" end="01:01.107">here</span> <span begin="01:01.107" end="01:01.562">with</span> <span begin="01:01.562" end="01:03.232">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为此 还请你与我一起</span></p><p begin="01:07.890" end="01:13.376" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:07.890" end="01:08.370">And</span> <span begin="01:08.370" end="01:08.825">I</span> <span begin="01:08.825" end="01:10.162">watched</span> <span begin="01:10.162" end="01:10.412">the</span> <span begin="01:10.412" end="01:11.499">wa</span><span begin="01:11.499" end="01:12.041">ter</span> <span begin="01:12.041" end="01:12.431">un</span><span begin="01:12.431" end="01:13.376">fold</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我亲眼所见这展开的水域</span></p><p begin="01:15.191" end="01:20.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key